WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.500
- You're a new TV dad, you have a baby.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.530
- [Chris] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:05.426
- So have you ever, how often
do you change the diapers?

00:00:05.426 --> 00:00:07.710
- Well, luckily on set,

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.056
I don't have to change any of the diapers.

00:00:09.056 --> 00:00:09.889
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:09.889 --> 00:00:14.143
- And when you're a TV dad,
there's like multiple children.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:15.910
We have triplets.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.847
- Yeah, we had twins
on the show that I did.

00:00:17.847 --> 00:00:18.680
- [Chris] Right.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.838
- That looked nothing alike, by the way.

00:00:19.838 --> 00:00:20.671
- [Chris] Right.

00:00:20.671 --> 00:00:21.740
- I'm like, there's one scene,

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:22.700
and then this other shot,
- Sure, sure.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.836
- I was like, "Oh God, that's just--"

00:00:24.836 --> 00:00:26.270
(laughing)
"Totally different baby."

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.330
But they're twins.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:29.996
- Oh really? They're just,
yeah, okay, yeah yeah.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:33.530
- Because babies can only
work like 13 minutes a day.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.363
- Yeah, it's true.
- Or something like that.

00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:35.610
- I want that schedule.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:38.253
- Which is an appropriate amount
of work to make a baby do.

00:00:38.253 --> 00:00:39.086
(laughing)

00:00:39.086 --> 00:00:40.500
- [Kirsten] Yeah, agreed.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.888
- Cause they didn't sign up.

00:00:41.888 --> 00:00:42.721
- No.

00:00:42.721 --> 00:00:44.820
- But no, I don't change
any of the diapers.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.360
- I think that's unfair.
I wanna see an Instagram

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.631
of you changing a diaper.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:51.015
(crowd cheering)

00:00:51.015 --> 00:00:51.956
- It's not that hard.

00:00:51.956 --> 00:00:52.970
- Seems like half are okay.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.210
- If you have a little boy,
then you gotta make sure

00:00:55.210 --> 00:00:56.250
that diaper goes on quick.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.155
Let's just put it that way.

00:00:57.155 --> 00:00:57.988
- Sure.

00:00:57.988 --> 00:00:59.950
- Have you been peed
on in the face, I have.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.270
- I'm sure I have, But I
got that thing on quick.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.090
I had a whole, you know those,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.962
this is getting maybe a little gross.

00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:07.530
- They have little, don't
they have little caps?

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:10.040
- They do, I use you know those pads

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.350
when you're breastfeeding,
those little pads?

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:13.183
Yeah, I just use those.

00:01:13.183 --> 00:01:16.214
So I just have those and
then slap in on there.

00:01:16.214 --> 00:01:17.500
- We just slap it on there.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:18.600
- Slap it on there.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.810
- No, it can get kind of
messy, I want a messy diaper

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.531
that you have to change,
that's the kind of friend I am.

00:01:23.531 --> 00:01:24.364
- [Kirsten] The poop is not fun.

00:01:24.364 --> 00:01:26.923
- You know what, I'll do it.
- Okay, okay.

